  "title": "WHIRLPOOL  5.0 Cu. Ft. Front Load Washer with Quick Wash Cycle - WFW6605MC",
  "handle": "whirlpool-wfw6605mc-5-0-cu-ft-front-load-washer-with-quick-wash-cycle",
  "body_html": "<h2>WHIRLPOOL \u00a05.0 Cu. Ft. Front Load Washer with Quick Wash Cycle - WFW6605MC</h2>\n<p>Clean regular-sized loads in as little as 25 minutes in this large capacity front load washer.* Get help removing everyday stains with the washing machine Steam Clean Option. The Tumble Fresh Option keeps clean clothes fresh up to 12 hours after the wash cycle ends. And with the washing machine Sanitize Cycle, increased water temperature sanitizes items like towels. *Based on a 10-lb load, Regular/Quick Cycle.</p>\n<h5><strong>Features</strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Quick Wash Cycle</li>\n<li>Intuitive Controls</li>\n<li>Option TumbleFresh(TM)</li>\n<li>Steam Clean Option</li>\n<li>Our Largest Capacity Front Load Washer at 5.0 Cu. Ft</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>\n<br><strong>Specification</strong>\n</h5>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n.tg  {border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;}\n.tg td{border-color:black;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\n  overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;word-break:normal;}\n.tg th{border-color:black;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\n  font-weight:normal;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 5px;word-break:normal;}\n.tg .tg-y1qo{background-color:#FFF;color:#313436;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle}\n.tg .tg-m1dr{background-color:#FFF;color:#313436;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}\n</style>\n<table class=\"tg\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tg-m1dr\">ADA Compliant</th>\n<th class=\"tg-y1qo\">ADA Compliant when installed on a 10in. riser, with the feet fully in</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Energy Rating</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">139</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Energy Star\u00ae Qualified</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">ENERGY STAR\u00ae Certified</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">IWF</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">3-1/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Adjustable Feet</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Lid/Door Finish</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Glass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Lid/Door Lock</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Lid/Door Swing</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Left</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Window</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Depth</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">33-1/4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Washer Door Opening Height Depth</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">25-11/16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Washer Door Opening Width</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">25-11/16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Width</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">27.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Advanced Vibration Control</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Dispense System</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Bleach &amp; Fabric Softener</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Eco Monitor/Efficiency Monitor</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Internal Heater</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Out of Balance Sensing</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Water Factor</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">3-1/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Automatic Temperature Controls</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">LCD Touch Screen</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Number of Wash Cycles</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">37</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Number of Washer Options</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Delay Start</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Number of Rinse Options</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Number of Soil Levels</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Number of Spin Speeds</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Number of Wash/Rinse Temperatures</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Pre Soak</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Temperature Selections</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Cold, Cool, Warm, Hot, Extra Hot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Stackable</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Water Faucet</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tg-m1dr\">Power Cord Included</td>\n<td class=\"tg-y1qo\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h5><strong>Manual</strong></h5>\n<ul class=\"grid grid--3-sm grid--4-md product__manuals\">\n<li class=\"grid__item\"><a href=\"https://images.webfronts.com/cache/melbhexnncub.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span>View Full Policy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"grid__item\"><a href=\"https://images.webfronts.com/cache/mejphxdfiacy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Download</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5>\n<br><strong>What Our Experts Think</strong>\n</h5>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"117\">\n<strong data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"65\">Spacious 5.0 cu. ft. Capacity</strong> \u2013 Wash more in fewer loads, perfect for families.</li>\n<li data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"208\">\n<strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"140\">Quick Wash Cycle</strong> \u2013 Cleans small loads in just 15 minutes for ultimate convenience.</li>\n<li data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"288\">\n<strong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"233\">Steam Clean Option</strong> \u2013 Removes tough stains and odors for a deeper clean.</li>\n<li data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"371\">\n<strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"313\">Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Touchscreen interface for effortless cycle selection.</li>\n<li data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"443\">\n<strong data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"405\">Advanced Vibration Control\u2122</strong> \u2013 Reduces noise for a quieter wash.</li>\n<li data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"538\">\n<strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"478\">Energy-Efficient Performance</strong> \u2013 Uses less water and power without compromising results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><strong>Q&amp;A</strong></h5>\n<p data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"420\"><strong data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"316\">Q: How fast is the Quick Wash cycle?</strong><br data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"319\">A: The Quick Wash cycle cleans small loads in about 15 minutes, perfect for when you\u2019re in a hurry.</p>\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"543\"><strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"465\">Q: What does the Steam Clean option do?</strong><br data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"468\">A: Steam deeply penetrates fabrics to help remove tough stains and odors.<br></p>\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"860\"><strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"737\">Q: Is this washer energy-efficient?</strong><br data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\">A: Yes, it\u2019s ENERGY STAR\u00a0 , using less water and electricity while maintaining powerful cleaning performance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"894\">Q: Does it sanitize clothes?</strong><br data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"897\">A: Yes, the Sanitize cycle eliminates 99.9% of common household bacteria.</p>\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1119\"><strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1020\">Q: What are the installation requirements?</strong><br data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1023\">A: It requires a standard 120V outlet, hot and cold water connections, and proper drain setup.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1250\"><strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1154\">Q: Can it handle bulky items?</strong><br data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1157\">A: Yes, the 5.0 cu. ft. capacity is ideal for large loads, including comforters and towels.</p>\n<h5>\n<strong>Maintenance Tips</strong><br>\n</h5>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"215\">\n<strong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"123\">Clean the Drum</strong> \u2013 Run a cleaning cycle with washer cleaner or vinegar monthly to prevent residue buildup.</li>\n<li data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"307\">\n<strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"241\">Wipe the Door Seal</strong> \u2013 Regularly clean the rubber gasket to prevent mold and mildew.</li>\n<li data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"414\">\n<strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"342\">Empty the Drain Pump Filter</strong> \u2013 Check and clean the drain filter every few months to prevent clogs.</li>\n<li data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"519\">\n<strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"441\">Leave the Door Ajar</strong> \u2013 Keep the door slightly open after use to allow airflow and prevent odors.</li>\n<li data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"618\">\n<strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"543\">Use HE Detergent</strong> \u2013 Always use high-efficiency detergent to avoid excess suds and buildup.</li>\n</ul>",
